{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234670","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234670","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1423467001:1":{"text":"お前さんたちが、サリエ様の言ってた助っ人だな！","source_cn":"你们就是沙利叶大人说的来帮忙的人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D8E1967BF89D79E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423467002:1":{"text":"ここで観光業をやるのがこんなに大変だとは思わなかったよ！","source_cn":"没想到这观光项目的开发难度有点大呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A5DD94C2E9B7FF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423467003:1":{"text":"何かあったんですか？","source_cn":"发生什么啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFC585AEE997667D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423467004:1":{"text":"観光スポットで思い出作りをするのが今どきの流行りだろ？それで言えば、ヘクト様の神殿は最高のスポットだ！","source_cn":"现在外面最流行的就是在观光点留念了！赫托老爷子的神殿肯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9B617B1551770C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423467005:1":{"text":"けど問題は、周りに獣が多すぎるんだよ！ここにいても、奴らの遠吠えが聞こえるだろ？万が一事故ったら大変だ。","source_cn":"可这神殿附近的野兽也太多了，我现在都能听到它们的嚎叫！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5297C6E3D04F8698","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":